  "core_text": "哎，你什么意思啊，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满，美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧，领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。小图啊，今天让你破费了，领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是，是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理呀。打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪儿敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。不要了，鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺儿多。领导，您看，鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹，是没有刺的。呵呵哈小图啊，你这菜点的也太多了。领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾。多这杯酒，我先敬您。小图最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思。领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬。领导，一杯，这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬。嗯，嘴硬，才守得住秘密。哈哈哈哈，你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了，几杯不喝就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，哎，我这肚子喝茶都能胖。领导，你那不叫胖，那叫宰相肚里能撑船，装的全是大事儿哈。呵呵呵小图啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花儿就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。哈哈，小图啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。小图啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交。推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，真是让我欲解心开啊，每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 50,
      "end_ms": 290,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 470,
      "end_ms": 1350,
      "text": "你什么意思啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1630,
      "end_ms": 3210,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3430,
      "end_ms": 4170,
      "text": "领导美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4170,
      "end_ms": 4510,
      "text": "美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 4810,
      "end_ms": 6010,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 6090,
      "end_ms": 8390,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10130,
      "end_ms": 12110,
      "text": "来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12490,
      "end_ms": 14210,
      "text": "领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14450,
      "end_ms": 16350,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16350,
      "end_ms": 18415,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 20590,
      "end_ms": 21710,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22370,
      "end_ms": 24230,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 24230,
      "end_ms": 26110,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 26230,
      "end_ms": 27650,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30410,
      "end_ms": 31610,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 32090,
      "end_ms": 33710,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33950,
      "end_ms": 35070,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 35370,
      "end_ms": 36690,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 38830,
      "end_ms": 39450,
      "text": "小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39850,
      "end_ms": 40990,
      "text": "今天让你破费了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41170,
      "end_ms": 41590,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41770,
      "end_ms": 43210,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 43210,
      "end_ms": 43930,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 44210,
      "end_ms": 45770,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 45770,
      "end_ms": 49070,
      "text": "不是来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49150,
      "end_ms": 50090,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50090,
      "end_ms": 50420,
      "text": "都不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50480,
      "end_ms": 50940,
      "text": "是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 51380,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 52020,
      "end_ms": 52620,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 52620,
      "end_ms": 53200,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 53320,
      "end_ms": 54700,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 54960,
      "end_ms": 56940,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 58539,
      "end_ms": 59340,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 59340,
      "end_ms": 60175,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 60630,
      "end_ms": 60990,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 60990,
      "end_ms": 61750,
      "text": "我哪儿敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 61890,
      "end_ms": 63955,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 64150,
      "end_ms": 65370,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 65570,
      "end_ms": 66945,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 67170,
      "end_ms": 67620,
      "text": "不要了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 68760,
      "end_ms": 69735,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 70150,
      "end_ms": 71275,
      "text": "可惜就是刺儿多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 71590,
      "end_ms": 71830,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 71830,
      "end_ms": 72255,
      "text": "您看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 72590,
      "end_ms": 73450,
      "text": "鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 73650,
      "end_ms": 75560,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 75560,
      "end_ms": 76385,
      "text": "是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 76720,
      "end_ms": 79375,
      "text": "呵呵哈小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 79800,
      "end_ms": 81375,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 81880,
      "end_ms": 83440,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 83440,
      "end_ms": 84960,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 84960,
      "end_ms": 85840,
      "text": "多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 85840,
      "end_ms": 86555,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 88870,
      "end_ms": 90375,
      "text": "小图最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 90660,
      "end_ms": 92375,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 92650,
      "end_ms": 93715,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 94080,
      "end_ms": 94780,
      "text": "听这意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 94860,
      "end_ms": 96120,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 96140,
      "end_ms": 96740,
      "text": "我得提前敬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 96740,
      "end_ms": 97000,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 97000,
      "end_ms": 97415,
      "text": "一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 99280,
      "end_ms": 100885,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 101310,
      "end_ms": 102185,
      "text": "就是嘴硬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 102550,
      "end_ms": 102790,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 103090,
      "end_ms": 103510,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 103570,
      "end_ms": 104555,
      "text": "才守得住秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 105390,
      "end_ms": 105840,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 108350,
      "end_ms": 109585,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 109910,
      "end_ms": 110290,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 110390,
      "end_ms": 111450,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 111450,
      "end_ms": 112715,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 113030,
      "end_ms": 114510,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 114510,
      "end_ms": 115010,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 115090,
      "end_ms": 116150,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 116150,
      "end_ms": 120045,
      "text": "几杯不喝就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 120400,
      "end_ms": 120780,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 120920,
      "end_ms": 121940,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 122100,
      "end_ms": 123115,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 126480,
      "end_ms": 126720,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 126820,
      "end_ms": 128295,
      "text": "我这肚子喝茶都能胖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 128700,
      "end_ms": 129100,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 129100,
      "end_ms": 129905,
      "text": "你那不叫胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 130170,
      "end_ms": 131430,
      "text": "那叫宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 131530,
      "end_ms": 133110,
      "text": "装的全是大事儿哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 133110,
      "end_ms": 136365,
      "text": "呵呵呵小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 136680,
      "end_ms": 138455,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 139030,
      "end_ms": 141410,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 141670,
      "end_ms": 144185,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 144920,
      "end_ms": 145865,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 146230,
      "end_ms": 147615,
      "text": "我刚种的花儿就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 148150,
      "end_ms": 149130,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 149290,
      "end_ms": 150765,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 151050,
      "end_ms": 153025,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 154210,
      "end_ms": 154570,
      "text": "哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 154740,
      "end_ms": 155335,
      "text": "小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 155630,
      "end_ms": 156970,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 156970,
      "end_ms": 157945,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 158340,
      "end_ms": 162395,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 163330,
      "end_ms": 164655,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 165690,
      "end_ms": 167750,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 167750,
      "end_ms": 170635,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 173330,
      "end_ms": 173805,
      "text": "小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 174090,
      "end_ms": 175410,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 175410,
      "end_ms": 176375,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 176580,
      "end_ms": 178525,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 179050,
      "end_ms": 180710,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 180710,
      "end_ms": 182435,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 182720,
      "end_ms": 183840,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 183920,
      "end_ms": 184660,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 184780,
      "end_ms": 185620,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 185900,
      "end_ms": 187100,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 187260,
      "end_ms": 189265,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 189540,
      "end_ms": 191705,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 192030,
      "end_ms": 193210,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 193350,
      "end_ms": 194690,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 194930,
      "end_ms": 197615,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 197840,
      "end_ms": 199100,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 199160,
      "end_ms": 200005,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 200360,
      "end_ms": 200500,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 200500,
      "end_ms": 202575,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 202840,
      "end_ms": 203525,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 203960,
      "end_ms": 204900,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 204980,
      "end_ms": 206325,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 206660,
      "end_ms": 208300,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 208420,
      "end_ms": 210115,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 210420,
      "end_ms": 211380,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 211440,
      "end_ms": 214555,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 214740,
      "end_ms": 215845,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 216100,
      "end_ms": 217295,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 217580,
      "end_ms": 218995,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 219270,
      "end_ms": 220615,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 221040,
      "end_ms": 222320,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 222320,
      "end_ms": 224045,
      "text": "真是让我欲解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 224460,
      "end_ms": 225745,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 226090,
      "end_ms": 228750,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 228890,
      "end_ms": 229690,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 230090,
      "end_ms": 232785,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 233040,
      "end_ms": 234360,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 234700,
      "end_ms": 236175,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 236420,
      "end_ms": 238825,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 239160,
      "end_ms": 240200,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 240460,
      "end_ms": 242885,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe40c7adb68b182d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 243210,
      "end_ms": 244925,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
